# FS09: zView started twice from EmuDESK (prep-card.sh zv2: window C:\ZVIEW\
# restored from NEWDESK.INF). Double-click ZVIEW.NAP (63,165) -> zView loads
# its 10 codecs (Pexec 3 each) and shows its menu; File (76,8) > Quit
# (104,203) -> back on the desktop. zView writes C:\ZVIEW\ZVIEW.INF when it
# quits, so the window now holds six items and ZVIEW.NAP has moved one slot
# right: the second double-click goes to (147,165). The SD commands of
# each start are counted per segment (mark-counts.py): B_ZV1_UP = first
# start, D_ZV2_UP = second start. Ticks hz_200 after "[desk] desktop up"
# (desk-arm-m3.py). A double click = down/up/down/up 3-5 ticks apart
# (measurement-2026-10-07-zview02 evb-desk.actions).
100 parkbr
400 mark A_IDLE
600 move 63 165
800 down
803 up
808 down
811 up
4000 mark B_ZV1_UP
4100 move 76 8
4400 move 104 203
4600 down
4603 up
6000 mark C_DESK_AGAIN
6200 move 147 165
6400 down
6403 up
6408 down
6411 up
9600 mark D_ZV2_UP
9700 move 76 8
10000 move 104 203
10200 down
10203 up
11600 mark E_DESK_FINAL
11800 parkbr
12000 mark END
